Crewhouse runs its AI engine, the OpenClaw gateway (MIT), as a supervised child process, on the AI accounts each
person signs in to themselves. Those accounts remain subject to their
vendors' terms.

The web app bundles the Nunito and JetBrains Mono fonts under the SIL Open
Font License 1.1 (see web/fonts/OFL.txt).

The AI account marks in web/src/logos.ts come from Simple Icons (CC0 1.0) and,
for Grok, Lobe Icons (MIT License, Copyright (c) 2023 LobeHub). The marks are
trademarks of their owners, shown only to name the account being signed in to.

The app and plugin logos in web/marks/ are each product's own official brand
asset, shown unmodified only to name the app or plugin, and remain trademarks
of their owners. No open-source licence is granted for them; each is used under
its owner's brand guidelines.

